Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: add OmniVision OV32B40 C-PHY sensor driver

Add a V4L2 CCI subdev driver for the OmniVision OV32B40 32 MP 3-trio
MIPI CSI-2 C-PHY image sensor supporting 3264x2448 (30 fps) and
6528x4896 (15 fps) RAW10 modes.
---
diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/ov32b40.c b/drivers/media/i2c/ov32b40.c
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..ede6ac61f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/ov32b40.c
@@ -0,0 +1,2206 @@
